qlcplus (6.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * EFX 2.0 rewrite: JSON-based effect library (keyframes, Bezier paths,
    arbitrary channel bindings, expression language)
  * Phase 7: HTTP upload API for external effect generators
    (POST /api/v1/effects, PUT /api/v1/effects/<id>)
  * Phase 8a: Visual path editor QML (EFXPathEditor)
  * Installs as qlcplus6, parallel to qlcplus and qlcplus5

